{% comment %}
  Official Trustpilot Review Collector widget.

  Configuration is the verified one supplied for this business unit. The
  bootstrap script is loaded once per page, async, and the widget is
  initialised explicitly afterwards — Trustpilot's own auto-init only runs on
  first load, so a Shopify section reload in the theme editor, or any later
  injection, would otherwise leave an empty box.

  This template is a Review Collector: it invites a review. It does not show
  a star rating, a score or a review count, and no official template can be
  made to show figures that are not published on the business unit yet.
  Nothing here fabricates a rating.

  Usage: {% render 'sos-trustpilot', placement: 'footer' %}
{% endcomment %}

<div class="sos-trustpilot sos-trustpilot--{{ placement | default: 'footer' }}">
  <div
    class="trustpilot-widget"
    data-locale="en-GB"
    data-template-id="56278e9abfbbba0bdcd568bc"
    data-businessunit-id="6afe3e2830d26ccd32cb3a0e"
    data-style-height="52px"
    data-style-width="100%"
  >
    <a href="https://www.trustpilot.com/review/sultanofstatues.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Trustpilot</a>
  </div>
</div>
